cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "SynectivSec: A Composition Theory for Federated Agent Authority"
abstract: >
  A formal composition algebra for the joint preservation of safety
  invariants across delegation chains, sequence policies, and cross-domain
  federation for AI agent action governance. Includes a TLA+ verified
  instance and a runnable attack harness demonstrating the tightness of
  the three compatibility conditions (PC, RS, CBAT).
